scenario: BATT-01
title: Laptop battery
area: Power
rows: F-BATT-02, F-BATT-03, F-BATT-04
machines: macbook, thinkpad, pavilion, laptop
needs: person
prereq: A laptop with its charger and a battery that is not full.
step: Look at the top bar.
expect: A battery icon shows the percentage and whether it charges.
clause: F-BATT-02.icon
step: Unplug the charger and wait ten seconds.
expect: The icon changes to discharging and the time left appears in Settings, System, Battery.
clause: F-BATT-04.discharging
step: Plug the charger in again.
expect: The icon shows charging within ten seconds.
clause: F-BATT-02.charging
step: If you can, let the battery fall to twenty percent while unplugged.
expect: A message appears once at twenty percent and again at ten, with a Plug in now note.
clause: F-BATT-03.low
